<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Redefinição de senha</title>
  </head>
  <body style="margin:0;background:#101214;color:#edf2f6;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
    <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;">Use este link seguro para criar uma nova senha no Portfolio CMS.</div>
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#101214;padding:40px 16px;">
      <tr><td align="center">
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:600px;background:#161a1e;border:1px solid #2b353f;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;">
          <tr><td style="height:5px;background:#9ed4f5;font-size:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:34px;">
              <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr>
                <td style="width:44px;height:44px;background:#9ed4f5;color:#102331;border-radius:14px;text-align:center;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;">AT</td>
                <td style="padding-left:14px;"><div style="font-size:15px;font-weight:700;">André Lucas Trevizan</div><div style="margin-top:3px;color:#a2afbc;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;">Portfolio CMS</div></td>
              </tr></table>
              <h1 style="margin:34px 0 12px;font-size:30px;line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-1px;">Redefina sua senha.</h1>
              <p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#a2afbc;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;">Olá, <strong style="color:#edf2f6;"><%= account.name %></strong>.</p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 28px;color:#a2afbc;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;">Recebemos uma solicitação para redefinir a senha associada a <strong style="color:#edf2f6;"><%= account.email %></strong>.</p>
              <a href="<%= portal_url %>/auth/reset-password?token=<%= encodeURIComponent(token) %>" style="display:inline-block;background:#9ed4f5;color:#102331;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 22px;border-radius:999px;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;">Criar nova senha</a>
              <div style="margin-top:28px;padding:18px;background:#101214;border:1px solid #2b353f;border-radius:16px;color:#a2afbc;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;">Este link expira em <strong style="color:#9ed4f5;"><%= expires_in_minutes %> minutos</strong> e só pode ser utilizado uma vez.</div>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr><td style="padding:20px 34px;background:#14191e;border-top:1px solid #2b353f;color:#a2afbc;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;">Não solicitou a alteração? Ignore este e-mail. Sua senha atual continuará funcionando.</td></tr>
        </table>
      </td></tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>
